{
  "_readme": [
    "Copy this file to .mcp.json to give this repository its own MCP servers.",
    "Claude Code reads project MCP servers from .mcp.json and, because .claude/settings.json",
    "sets enableAllProjectMcpServers, they are active without a per-session prompt.",
    "",
    "Rules for this repository:",
    "1. Use the MCP servers that are already connected globally before adding a new one.",
    "   The full inventory is in status/TOOLING.md (generated by scripts/discover_tooling.py).",
    "2. Never put a credential in this file. Reference an environment variable instead;",
    "   the secrets preflight (scripts/preflight-secrets.sh) blocks a commit that contains one.",
    "3. Every server added here must also be documented in docs/07-mcp-plugins.md so the",
    "   inventory stays explainable two handovers from now.",
    "4. stdio servers run inside the Termux/Debian environment on the phone; keep them small.",
    "",
    "DroidRoute itself federates the owner's MCP servers at runtime - that is a product feature",
    "(docs/07-mcp-plugins.md), independent of what the build agent uses here."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "filesystem": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem", "."],
      "env": {}
    },
    "git": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "uvx",
      "args": ["mcp-server-git", "--repository", "."],
      "env": {}
    },
    "github": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@modelcontextprotocol/server-github"],
      "env": {
        "GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN": "${GITHUB_PERSONAL_ACCESS_TOKEN}"
      }
    },
    "memory": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "npx",
      "args": ["-y", "@modelcontextprotocol/server-memory"],
      "env": {}
    }
  }
}
